    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Very Own &quot;Perfect Sword&quot;!</strong> <br>Immerse yourself in the life of a medieval blacksmith. Take charge of every step in the forging process \u2013 from heating the steel and shaping it with a hammer to cooling and grinding. Every detail has been meticulously recreated to provide you with a truly immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Master Blacksmith:</strong> Improve your skills, earn gold, and expand your forge into a true hub of craftsmanship. Take on more challenging commissions and personally test the quality of your forged weapons to assess their properties and craftsmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your very own unique Sword</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/72be04b208fc70a9526f8a7873bcbbc5.poster.avif?t=1738059184\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/72be04b208fc70a9526f8a7873bcbbc5.webm?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/72be04b208fc70a9526f8a7873bcbbc5.mp4?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the  blade in every way possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/7692c3840388a78fc6a20663c323e502.poster.avif?t=1738059184\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/7692c3840388a78fc6a20663c323e502.webm?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/7692c3840388a78fc6a20663c323e502.mp4?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your sword in a fully physical combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/cec8671e20ecae8885d04177549bb8bc.poster.avif?t=1738059184\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/cec8671e20ecae8885d04177549bb8bc.webm?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/cec8671e20ecae8885d04177549bb8bc.mp4?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic simulation of the entire forging process</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/d423eaf32a32619692d926be794d62ac.poster.avif?t=1738059184\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/d423eaf32a32619692d926be794d62ac.webm?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/d423eaf32a32619692d926be794d62ac.mp4?t=1738059184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single vertex point is being calculated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474260/extras/6baa06ca327f4d2e8815